que me hubiera gustado tener?

1664
01:24:03,372 --> 01:24:04,373
¿Qué?

1665
01:24:05,040 --> 01:24:06,041
Un hermano.

1666
01:24:08,711 --> 01:24:11,172
Escúchame. Si ganas esto...

1667
01:24:11,255 --> 01:24:12,256
si ganas...

1668
01:24:12,965 --> 01:24:15,259
