1673
01:24:23,684 --> 01:24:25,728
-Gracias, Pete.
-Y te lo mereces.

1674
01:24:26,604 --> 01:24:27,605
Sí.

1675
01:24:52,087 --> 01:24:53,464
Oigan, escúchenme.

1676
01:24:53,547 --> 01:24:54,757
Estuve pensando

1677
01:24:55,841 --> 01:24:58,093
